Priority: P1
Preconditions:
User authenticated.
Steps:
Remove room_id from request body.
Submit request.
Expected Result:
Status code 422.
Validation error returned for room_id.
No transaction created.
Why it matters:
Ensures required fields are enforced.

TC-05: Non-Existing room_id
Category: Validation
Priority: P1
Preconditions:
User authenticated.
Steps:
Use room_id that does not exist.
Submit request.
Expected Result:
Status code 422.
Appropriate validation error returned.
No database changes occur.
Why it matters:
Prevents transactions against invalid rooms.

